                "evidence": "src/greeting.mjs:1-3 interpolates `name` with no type or presence check: `return `Hello, ${name}!`;`. Consequently greet() evaluates to 'Hello, undefined!' and greet(null) to 'Hello, null!'. No in-repo caller reaches this path: the only references (scripts/validate.mjs:4, scripts/contract.mjs:5) both pass the literal 'AEH', and no spec/README defines an input contract. This is an unguarded edge case, not a confirmed contract violation.",
